    "slotType" : "fullsize_limo_lights",
    //  The bar's TV plays videos: each of its nine channels plays the WebM files of its folder
    //  (vehicles/fullsize/limotv/channels/ch1 .. ch9) one after another; a channel without any shows
    //  "No video input". A channel can show a live stream instead (craptech_limotv_live.py). The sound
    //  comes from the set, played by the game's UI. The set's own buttons, under the screen: POWER
    //  (the round one), CH up / CH down, VL up / VL down (volume), DISP (shows the channel number); a click
    //  on the screen also goes to the next channel (and switches it on). Or the same actions in Controls.
    //  It runs from the accessory position on.
    //  Generated by gen_limotv.py from the stock part.
